WEBVTT

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:15.160
<i>Ministry of Foreign Affairs
 negotiator Shindo Kojiro was</i>

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:19.130
<i>absorbed into a huge structure
along with a passenger plane</i>

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:21.750
<i>that suddenly appeared at Haneda Airport.</i>

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:27.400
<i>In order to rescue the passengers,
the Japanese government</i>

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>works together with theoretical
physicist, Shinawa Kanata.</i>

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>However, the task proves to be difficult
because of the structure's powerful walls.</i>

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:40.850
<i>It was then that Shindo Kojiro
and a mysterious figure</i>

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:46.850
<i>appeared on top of the giant structure.</i>

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:50.070
Mankind...

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:53.490
A voice...

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:55.700
This isn't a normal sound.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.120
It's like it just appeared 
in front of my eardrums.

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:05.620
I desire to establish communication of wills.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:09.130
Wow! It's like it soaks into my brain!

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:11.880
I want to secure unification of wills.

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:16.160
Isn't he...

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:18.220
He's one of the passengers from the plane!

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:20.600
Shindo...

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:23.930
One of the negotiators from 
the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:25.890
His name is Shindo Kojiro.

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:29.440
Shindo? The one from the Tokyo Protocol?

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:33.050
Shindo Kojiro, the tough negotiator?

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:40.700
Kado.

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:47.070
It is ready.

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:48.210
I wish to be spoken to.

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:54.710
Can you hear me?

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:56.370
Shindo?

00:01:56.370 --> 00:02:00.850
I am Shindo Kojiro, an official with the

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:02.510
Ministry of Foreign Affairs.

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:05.140
Approximately 30 hours ago,

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:10.230
I was aboard a plane at the airport when 
I was absorbed by this massive object.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:14.310
It appears the name of this 
huge object is "Kado."

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:18.320
It belongs to this man, Yaha-kui zaShunina.

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:23.710
Yaha-kui zaShunina claims to 
be a different order of being,

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.240
who came from a different universe.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:28.750
This is the famous 
"Contact with the Unknown," huh?

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.750
He first desires to communicate 
with our country, Japan,

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:35.880
and the Japanese government.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.050
Prime Minister.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:37.880
Yeah.

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:39.970
He requests that

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:43.890
a method of communication with the 
government be established immediately.

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:45.140
I set a time.

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:47.740
Six seconds.

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:48.870
Too short.

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:51.850
One minute.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:54.360
No. It's not enough at all.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:57.740
He's negotiating?

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:00.240
One hour.

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:02.740
Two hours.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.410
Three hours.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.250
Three hours.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:17.480
Yaha-kui zaShunina and I will 
come out again in three hours.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:23.860
Please have a method prepared for us 
to communicate with the government.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:25.300
Kado.

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:30.270
How about that?

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.310
95%.

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:33.630
That's plenty.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:35.520
90 and 5 percent.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:38.530
Wait.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:42.530
I want to tell the people 
outside our situation.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:45.150
I consent.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:55.540
Lastly, I will tell you the status of the 
passenger plane and the passengers aboard.

00:03:56.330 --> 00:04:01.060
251 passengers and crew are safe.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:05.230
Yaha-kui zaShunina is 
providing us with water,

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:08.560
food, and the other necessities for life.

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:13.560
I can report that a bare minimum 
of safety has been secured.

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:19.160
In other words, those 251 people are hostages.

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:33.390
We will now establish a 
"Kado Government Response HQ"

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:35.960
within the official residence 
of the prime minister.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:37.940
The decisions of this body

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:41.710
will carry the same force as 
decisions made by the full cabinet,

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:46.480
allowing it to respond rapidly 
to the Kado situation.

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:48.760
Which means we need a representative, too.

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:53.130
It will take the form of a government 
delegation, and we'll choose a negotiator.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:54.670
Draw up a list immediately.

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:58.310
<b>Ministry of Foreign Affairs</b>

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:01.820
<b>Minister's Secretariat</b>

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.160
Sasauchi-san?

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:09.010
Foreign Affairs Bureau Chief of Police 
<b>Sasauchi Naoki</b>

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:09.580
Just as we expected, they've 
asked us to prepare negotiators.

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.850
They're going to negotiate with that thing?

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:14.400
Who do you think is appropriate for the job?

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:15.330
Shindo-san.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:20.720
I'm not sure whether it's a good or 
bad thing that he's on the other side.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:24.640
We need to pick someone 
who's a match for him.

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:29.090
She's coming back today, right?

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.640
<b>I am Yaha-kui zaShunina</b>

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:41.330
Tsukai!

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:44.860
I have a job for you.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:49.130
Ministry of Foreign Affairs 
International Negotiator
 <b>Tsukai Saraka</b>

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:47.900
Right.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:25.130
Novo

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:28.340
<b>28 Hours Ago</b>

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:43.870
Hey, Hanamori! Hanamori!

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:45.860
Hanamori!

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:54.340
Shindo-san...

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:58.870
I don't feel so good.

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:12.010
Sir, if you don't feel well, please
set your seat back and rest.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.700
Thanks...

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:14.760
Are you the captain?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:19.470
Yes. I'm Hidaka, this plane's captain.

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:19.470
Captain
  <b>Hidaka Yukio</b>

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:28.920
Since the plane is in operation, 
I'm the person in charge right now.

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:30.850
But, this situation is so extraordinary

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:32.950
that I'm unable to even
 figure out what's going on.

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:34.570
Shindo-san.

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:39.950
I'm sorry, but can you 
help me handle this?

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:41.550
Of course.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:43.960
First, I'll get you up to date.

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:49.460
Co-captain
 <b>Shinohara Hidehiko</b>

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.170
First, communications aren't working.

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:50.850
Communication with the outside is cut off.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.630
<b>Out of Service Area</b>

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.290
Visibility is zero, too.

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:56.300
The lights aren't reflecting 
off anything, are they?

00:08:56.720 --> 00:09:00.360
The plane's stopped, which implies 
that we're the touching the ground,

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:02.390
but who knows what's going on outside.

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.980
Is there anything else you know?

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:06.360
It seems there's air.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:08.810
The air pressure is the same as Earth.

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.210
Is it poisonous?

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:12.590
It's already been ventilated 
into the aircraft.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.300
The climate control system 
takes in air from the outside.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:18.940
If it was poisonous, we'd all be dead.

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:20.410
I see.

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:22.030
Captain!

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:59.440
Is there really a surface?

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:23.100
Is this a dream?

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.820
What is this?

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:44.370
<i>What am I looking at?</i>

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:46.840
<i>Something supernatural?</i>

00:10:56.780 --> 00:11:00.790
<i>Some kind of unknown technology, 
beyond humanity's imagination?</i>

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:05.110
<i>Or maybe...</i>

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:10.270
<i>A real God?</i>

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:16.670
Shindo-san?!

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:18.110
I'm coming down there!

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.440
Shindo-san!

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:29.790
Hang in there! Shindo-san! Are you okay?

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:31.180
<i>What is this? What is this? What is this?!</i>

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:31.180
Shindo-san!

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:35.190
My head's going to burst! It's going to burst!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.170
Hey, you!

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:35.190
What did you do to Shindo-san?

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:36.870
Stop it, now!

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.570
Stop it! Please!

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:38.190
He's suffering!

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:41.220
Stop standing there and say something!

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:42.640
Say something!

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:48.330
Shindo-san?

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:17.980
I wonder...

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:25.490
Is he trying to find a way to communicate?

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:33.530
Sh-Shindo-san!

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:40.520
I...

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.840
I am Shindo Kojiro.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:47.840
I am Shindo Kojiro.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:52.590
Who are you?

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:57.850
I am Yaha-kui zaShunina.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:01.030
Yaha-kui zaShunina?

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:01.030
Yaha-ku... what?

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:09.490
This?

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:11.850
Kado.

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:54.030
I have just gained the bare minimum 
of information from this machine.

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:59.090
Now I have learned the fundamental 
method of communication.

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:03.640
Are my words reaching you, Shindo Kojiro?

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.800
They sure are, Yaha-kui zaShunina.

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:13.500
Shindo Kojiro, I, Yaha-kui zaShunina,

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:17.030
request your cooperation.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:30.720
<b>25 Hours Ago</b>

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:30.070
Before I decide whether or not to help you,

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:32.820
I want you to hear our requests.

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:34.270
I wish to hear them.

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:40.910
First, I would like you to let all the 
passengers, all the people here, go outside.

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:43.770
An amount of time will be necessary.

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:45.610
How long?

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:49.910
111100—

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:50.170
I'm sorry.

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:53.390
Can you put that in seconds or hours?

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:55.010
Base 60.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:58.830
2,483,136 seconds.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:01.640
689.76 hours.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:04.020
689 hours...

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:07.610
Um... 29 days?

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:08.850
No.

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:10.800
That will impede their survival.

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:14.160
Their lives must be maintained at all costs.

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:16.810
I understand how to maintain lives.

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:21.410
It is possible to provide 
metabolic fuel, "food."

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.550
Really?

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:23.920
For 30 days?

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.420
I accept.

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:28.420
And...

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:33.430
You should put on clothes.

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:34.700
It is possible.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:05.740
We have two pieces of bread per passenger.

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:05.890
<b>23 Hours Ago</b>

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.880
Understood. Please wait a moment.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:10.190
I'm sorry. We have no alcohol available.

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.700
Here you are.

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:17.460
I will now answer your questions 
and share information.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:23.790
I, Yaha-kui zaShunina,
and the boundary unit, Kado.

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:26.620
"Boundary unit, Kado"?

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:30.910
The source of all these, Novo.

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:57.820
<b>10 Hours Ago</b>

00:18:03.820 --> 00:18:05.520
Shindo Kojiro.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:08.520
Don't scare me, Yaha-kui zaShunina.

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:09.990
It was a misunderstanding.

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:11.700
I did not intend to surprise you.

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:14.700
I know.

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:16.070
Then we understand one another.

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:21.410
I will leave Kado in 10 hours.

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:26.410
I will tell the people 
outside what I told you.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:28.860
That is why I have come here.

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:33.780
So we can leave in 29 days?

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:37.860
The world's going to change 
a lot during that time.

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:40.990
It's a shame I won't be 
able to see it myself.

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:41.940
You will.

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:47.730
Shindo Kojiro desires to leave with me.

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:49.390
But...

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:52.170
I still can't leave, can I?

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:58.060
Kado is presently doing 
the processing required

00:18:58.060 --> 00:19:00.480
to transfer the people inside to the outside.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.750
The speed of the operation 
depends on the subject's mass,

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:07.000
and it will take 29 days to process them all.

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:12.990
However, it will only require 
2.74 hours to process you alone.

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:15.590
If that's how the system worked 
you should've told me sooner.

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:17.890
A fracture in our communication.

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:18.760
I apologize.

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:21.510
Shindo Kojiro.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:26.220
I will advance this world.

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:31.770
And for that, I need to
 communicate with all of humanity.

00:19:32.510 --> 00:19:37.780
The factor named Shindo Kojiro 
will accelerate that process.

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:40.060
This will be my second request.

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:44.530
I seek your help.

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:57.260
The gap between you and 
humanity is far too large.

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:04.260
To tell you the truth, 
standing in gaps like that is my job.

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:09.520
I'll go along with you and 
your "advance" of this world.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.020
The fracture has disappeared.

00:20:12.590 --> 00:20:14.160
Interaction with the outside world

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:16.020
can occur in 10 hours, 
2 minutes, and 5 seconds.

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:18.520
Shindo Kojiro.

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:27.110
Call me Shindo.

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:28.010
Why?

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:32.620
A shortened name is a sign that you've 
become closer to someone, zaShunina.

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:34.870
I understand.

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:36.430
It has a meaning.

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:38.090
Shindo.

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:38.740
Yeah.

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:40.630
What's left...

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:44.790
Is there something else we 
can do about that outfit?

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:49.970
<b>Present</b>

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:04.030
And when the king saw this, he went out 
into the yard and talked to the dog.

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:24.130
Mankind.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:25.760
Here he is!

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:33.210
You are currently attempting to decide
 as soon as possible if I am friend or foe.

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:40.020
But in all events, there is no 
such thing as a 100% probability.

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:44.970
You must continue to think:

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:49.450
am I a foe, a friend?

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:52.710
That is right.

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:56.140
To constantly think...

00:21:57.050 --> 00:22:03.630
is the only right answer in the world.

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:40.010
Yaha-kui zaShunina is requesting
a meeting with the Japanese government.

00:23:40.010 --> 00:23:42.350
So we're finally going to meet the alien.

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:46.190
Does that mean that you're
going to tell us about yourself?

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:49.410
I know what suits humanity.

00:23:48.460 --> 00:23:52.000
Wam
